Scope

This license applies to the following components of the QNet project:

COVERED BY BSL 1.1 (Blockchain Infrastructure):
- core/                       (Blockchain core modules: consensus, mempool, state, sharding)
- development/               (Node implementation, integration, contracts, VM)
                              EXCEPT development/qnet-sdk/ -- see NOT COVERED below
- audit/                     (Security audit tools and compliance tests)
- governance/                (DAO and governance mechanisms)
- deployment/                (Node deployment and orchestration)
- infrastructure/            (API, node infrastructure, backend services)
- testing/                   (Integration tests, testnet tools)
- monitoring/                (Production monitoring and metrics)

NOT COVERED (Apache-2.0):
- applications/qnet-mobile/     (Mobile wallet - see applications/qnet-mobile/LICENSE)
- applications/qnet-wallet/     (Browser extension wallet - Apache-2.0)
- applications/qnet-explorer/   (Blockchain explorer - Apache-2.0)
- applications/qnet-cli/        (CLI tools - Apache-2.0)
- development/qnet-sdk/         (Client SDK - Apache-2.0)

NOTE: All of the above connect to blockchain nodes via HTTP API only and contain
no proprietary blockchain code. They are independently licensed under Apache-2.0.

